## 🟡 MEDIUM SEVERITY ISSUES

### 11. **Synchronous File Operations Block Event Loop**

**Location:** Lines 103-107, 110-114, 117-121, 124-128, 131-135  
**Severity:** **MEDIUM**

**Failure Mechanism:**
```javascript
const certBytes = readFileSync(CA_CRT);
res.writeHead(200, { /* ... */ });
res.end(certBytes);
```

**Impact:**
1. Synchronous I/O blocks Node.js event loop
2. High traffic can cause request queuing
3. Poor scalability under load

**Refactored Code:**
```javascript
// Use async file operations with caching
const fileCache = new Map();
const CACHE_TTL = 60 * 1000; // 1 minute

async function serveStaticFile(res, filePath, contentType, cacheControl) {
  if (fileCache.has(filePath)) {
    const cached = fileCache.get(filePath);
    if (Date.now() - cached.timestamp < CACHE_TTL) {
      res.writeHead(200, {
        "Content-Type": contentType,
        "Cache-Control": cacheControl,
        "Content-Length": cached.data.length
      });
      res.end(cached.data);
      return;
    }
  }

  try {
    const data = await fs.promises.readFile(filePath);
    fileCache.set(filePath, { data, timestamp: Date.now() });
    res.writeHead(200, {
      "Content-Type": contentType,
      "Cache-Control": cacheControl,
      "Content-Length": data.length
    });
    res.end(data);
  } catch (err) {
    res.writeHead(404, { "Content-Type": "text/plain" });
    res.end("Not Found");
  }
}
```

---

### 12. **Missing Connection Timeout Configuration**

**Location:** Lines 250-255  
**Severity:** **MEDIUM**

**Failure Mechanism:**
No timeout on HTTP connections allows slowloris-style attacks.

**Refactored Code:**
```javascript
// Add timeout configuration
httpsServer.timeout = 60000; // 60 second timeout
httpsServer.keepAliveTimeout = 65000; // Slightly longer than timeout

httpsServer.on("connection", (socket) => {
  socket.setTimeout(60000);
  socket.on("timeout", () => {
    socket.destroy();
  });
});
```

---

### 13. **No Health Check Endpoint**

**Location:** N/A  
**Severity:** **MEDIUM**

**Failure Mechanism:**
Orchestration layer cannot verify gateway health status.

**Refactored Code:**
```javascript
// Add health check endpoint
if (pathname === "/health" || pathname === "/healthz") {
  res.writeHead(200, {
    "Content-Type": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
    "Cache-Control": "no-cache"
  });
  res.end(JSON.stringify({
    status: "ok",
    timestamp: Date.now(),
    uptime: process.uptime(),
    memory: process.memoryUsage()
  }));
  return;
}
```

