## ✅ FINAL VERIFICATION CHECKLIST

- [ ] All critical vulnerabilities patched
- [ ] Authentication tokens never in URLs
- [ ] Path traversal fully prevented
- [ ] Rate limiting implemented
- [ ] Security headers on all responses
- [ ] Request body size limits enforced
- [ ] WebSocket authentication validated
- [ ] No hardcoded secrets in source
- [ ] Error messages don't leak internals
- [ ] Health check endpoint available
- [ ] Certificate expiry monitored
- [ ] Audit logging enabled

---

**Audit Complete.** This gateway requires immediate security hardening before production deployment. Priority should be given to authentication bypass and path traversal vulnerabilities.
